.TH LIBMYUTILS 3 "September 2026" "v0.4.1" "Custom C Utilities Library Manual"
.SH NAME
libmyutils \- Custom C string handling and file utilities library
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "mystrfunctions.h"
.br
.B #include "myfilefunctions.h"
.br
.BI "int mystrlen(const char* " s ");"
.br
.BI "int wordCount(FILE* " file ", int* " lines ", int* " words ", int* " chars ");"
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B libmyutils
is a general-purpose utility library split into string functions and file functions.
It provides core custom implementations like calculating lengths and analyzing file word metrics.
